00:03:16.469 --> 00:03:27.069
While everyone is teeing up their questions, Clany Ben Venuto, well, ask, how do you feel about being part of one of the greatest shows of all time?
在大家准备问题的时候，Clany Ben Venuto问：作为有史以来最伟大的剧集之一的一部分，你有什么感觉？

00:03:27.069 --> 00:03:29.069
Well, that's very nice.
嗯，这真是太好了。

00:03:29.069 --> 00:03:32.909
You know, I just did Rain Wilson's podcast, Soul Boom, the other day.
你知道的，前几天我刚上了雷恩·威尔逊（Rainn Wilson）的播客节目《Soul Boom》。

00:03:32.909 --> 00:03:45.270
And we were sharing about the weirdness and the great feeling of, you know, having been on a show, both of us on long-running iconic shows at around the same time.
我们当时在交流那种奇妙又美妙的感觉，就是我们俩大约在同一时期都出演过长盛不衰的标志性剧集。

00:03:45.270 --> 00:03:57.389
And what's strange is like, you don't quite know you're on a show that's going to have legs until 20 years later, and people are still discovering it and talking about it and introducing it to people.
奇怪的是，你当时并不知道自己参演的是一部能经受住时间考验的剧集，直到20年过去了，人们还在不断发现它、讨论它，并把它推荐给其他人。

00:03:57.389 --> 00:04:07.189
So at the time, you know that people like it and you know that it's working and you You keep getting renewed, which is the means the network believes in you.
所以在当时，你知道人们喜欢它，你知道它很成功，而且你的剧集不断获得续订，这意味着电视网对你们充满信心。

00:04:07.189 --> 00:04:21.670
But we both were kind of joking that there were other shows on the air at the same time that you've probably never heard of that got a lot more press, a lot more kind of critical claim and attention than our shows.
但我们俩当时也开玩笑说，当时播出的其他一些剧集，你可能听都没听说过，它们却获得了比我们的剧集多得多的媒体报道、更多的评论界赞誉和关注。

00:04:21.670 --> 00:04:27.949
But time has been very good to how I made your mother and the office.
但时间对《老爸老妈浪漫史》和《办公室》非常仁慈。

00:04:27.949 --> 00:04:33.629
