00:33:36.700 --> 00:33:43.299
And so we had a really funny, sweet moment and took this picture and she had posted it once before.
所以我们有了一个非常有趣、温馨的时刻，拍了这张照片，她以前也发过一次。

00:33:43.299 --> 00:33:50.980
And I'm gonna reach out to her, but I would just, if she happens to be listening, we would love to have Selena Gomez on how we made your mother.
我要联系她，但如果她刚好在听的话，我们真的很希望能邀请赛琳娜·戈麦斯来上《老爸老妈浪漫史》。

00:33:50.980 --> 00:33:52.619
because she's a huge how I met your mother fan.
因为她是个超级《老爸老妈浪漫史》粉丝。

00:33:52.619 --> 00:33:53.900
She posts about it there.
她经常在上面发相关的内容。

00:33:53.900 --> 00:33:58.460
She even just posts kind of random pictures where it's just on in the background.
她甚至会发一些随意的照片，背景里正播着这部剧。

