So Selena, if you're listening, I'm gonna reach out, but we would love to have you to talk to you about your love of the show and why you love it so much.
所以赛琳娜，如果你在听的话，我会去联系你的，但我们非常希望你能来聊聊你对这部剧的喜爱以及为什么这么喜欢它。

